{
    "title": "FOX 13 Tampa Bay: News",
    "description": "News doesn't wait, why should you? Take FOX 13 News everywhere you go! Our app connects you with top stories in and around the Tampa area\u2014 complete with breaking news alerts, live video, and real-time weather forecasts.\r\n\r\nWe cover topics that matter most to you including local & national headlines, weather, sports, traffic, politics, entertainment, food, education, crime and so much more.\r\n\r\nNEWS & VIDEO\r\n- Breaking news delivered as fast as it breaks \r\n- Live stream newscasts daily\r\n- Streamlined content display for a user-friendly experience \r\n- Updates from news anchors Mark Wilson, Kelly Ring, Linda Hurtado, Chris Cato, Cynthia Smoot, Haley Hinds and Lloyd Sowers\r\n\r\n WEATHER\r\n- SkyTower Radar views 24 hours a day \r\n- Hourly conditions and 7-day forecasts so you're always ready for your day\r\n- Fresh video updates from FOX 13\u2019s meteorologists Paul Dellegatto, Dave Osterberg, Jim Weber, Tyler Eliasen and Brittany Rainey\r\n-  MyFoxHurricane for disaster preparedness\r\n- Severe weather alerts including hurricanes, tornadoes, lightning, flooding\r\n\r\nTRAFFIC\r\n- Up to the minute alerts from Vanessa Ruffes including traffic maps, delays, and accidents \r\n- Information on bridges including the Skyway, Howard Frankland Bridge, Gandy Bridge and the Courtney Campbell Causeway\r\n\r\nGOOD DAY TAMPA\r\n - Easily access content from your morning crew Russell Rhodes, Laura Moody, Jennifer Epstein, Walter Allen, Dave Osterberg, Vanessa Ruffes and Charley Belcher\r\n- Catch up on segments fromCharley\u2019s World, Hometown Heroes, and more\r\n- Browse delicious recipes dinner, lunch and breakfast\r\n\r\nSPORTS\r\n- Updated coverage Sports Director Scott Smith who oversees the largest sports staff in the Tampa Bay area \r\n- We cover the Buccaneers, Lightning, Rays, College Sports (Florida, FSU, Miami, USF, UCF and the University of Tampa) plus Florida high school sports and prep action\r\n\r\n\r\n LET\u2019S BE FRIENDS! Follow us on:\r\n \u2022 facebook.com/fox13tampa\r\n \u2022 instagram.com /fox13.news\r\n \u2022 twitter.com/fox13news \r\nUse #welivehere to join the chatter and be featured!\r\n\r\n\r\nOur News App provides you the option to enable specific geolocation tracking for precise location-based advertisements (review our Privacy Policy for more information on our use and sharing of location information). \r\n\r\nWe may work with mobile advertising companies and other similar entities that help deliver advertisements tailored to your interests. For more information about such advertising practices, and to opt-out in mobile apps, see https://www.fox13news.com/ad-choices. You may also download the App Choices app at www.aboutads.info/appchoices.",
    "descriptionHTML": "News doesn&#39;t wait, why should you? Take FOX 13 News everywhere you go! Our app connects you with top stories in and around the Tampa area\u2014 complete with breaking news alerts, live video, and real-time weather forecasts.<br><br>We cover topics that matter most to you including local &amp; national headlines, weather, sports, traffic, politics, entertainment, food, education, crime and so much more.<br><br>NEWS &amp; VIDEO<br>- Breaking news delivered as fast as it breaks <br>- Live stream newscasts daily<br>- Streamlined content display for a user-friendly experience <br>- Updates from news anchors Mark Wilson, Kelly Ring, Linda Hurtado, Chris Cato, Cynthia Smoot, Haley Hinds and Lloyd Sowers<br><br> WEATHER<br>- SkyTower Radar views 24 hours a day <br>- Hourly conditions and 7-day forecasts so you&#39;re always ready for your day<br>- Fresh video updates from FOX 13\u2019s meteorologists Paul Dellegatto, Dave Osterberg, Jim Weber, Tyler Eliasen and Brittany Rainey<br>-  MyFoxHurricane for disaster preparedness<br>- Severe weather alerts including hurricanes, tornadoes, lightning, flooding<br><br>TRAFFIC<br>- Up to the minute alerts from Vanessa Ruffes including traffic maps, delays, and accidents <br>- Information on bridges including the Skyway, Howard Frankland Bridge, Gandy Bridge and the Courtney Campbell Causeway<br><br>GOOD DAY TAMPA<br> - Easily access content from your morning crew Russell Rhodes, Laura Moody, Jennifer Epstein, Walter Allen, Dave Osterberg, Vanessa Ruffes and Charley Belcher<br>- Catch up on segments fromCharley\u2019s World, Hometown Heroes, and more<br>- Browse delicious recipes dinner, lunch and breakfast<br><br>SPORTS<br>- Updated coverage Sports Director Scott Smith who oversees the largest sports staff in the Tampa Bay area <br>- We cover the Buccaneers, Lightning, Rays, College Sports (Florida, FSU, Miami, USF, UCF and the University of Tampa) plus Florida high school sports and prep action<br><br><br> LET\u2019S BE FRIENDS! Follow us on:<br> \u2022 facebook.com/fox13tampa<br> \u2022 instagram.com /fox13.news<br> \u2022 twitter.com/fox13news <br>Use #welivehere to join the chatter and be featured!<br><br><br>Our News App provides you the option to enable specific geolocation tracking for precise location-based advertisements (review our Privacy Policy for more information on our use and sharing of location information). <br><br>We may work with mobile advertising companies and other similar entities that help deliver advertisements tailored to your interests. For more information about such advertising practices, and to opt-out in mobile apps, see https://www.fox13news.com/ad-choices. You may also download the App Choices app at www.aboutads.info/appchoices.",
